Have you checked the permissions and ownership of the nethack binary and
the record file?

I'm not sure about knoppix, but on Debian it works like this: the record
file is owner by root:games and is writable for the group. The nethack
binary is owned by root:games and has the SGID (set group id) bit set
(chmod 2755).

You may want to try playing a game as root. If that does saves the score
the problem is probably in the permissions.

